                                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIcomSignalValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter shall be used to define a signal value which shall be compared (CanIcomSignalOperation) with the masked CanIcomSignalMask value of the received signal (CanIcomSignalRef).</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
