                  <SHORT-NAME>CanMainFunctionBusoffPeriod</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the period for cyclic call to Can_MainFunction_Busoff. Unit is seconds.</L-2>
